      "contribution": "Measured two recruiting-stage signals. Wording: no reliable masculine-coded excess in Fellows or research postings, and the lexicon is weakly valid here (κ = 0.24). Visibility: of named people with public self-identification, 3 of 28 are women (10.7%).",
